#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.1.1 standardizes the WiFi API, updates GC2145 / LSM6DSOX drivers, and "
"fixes :class:`machine.I2C` scan, ``sensor.read_reg``, and "
":func:`sensor.set_framerate`. The WINC/NINA WiFi API changed — read the "
"breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v4.1.1 menstandarisasi API WiFi, memperbarui driver GC2145 / LSM6DSOX, dan "
"memperbaiki pemindaian :class:`machine.I2C`\\ , ``sensor.read_reg``\\ , dan "
":func:`sensor.set_framerate`\\ . API WiFi WINC/NINA berubah — baca perubahan"
" yang memutus kompatibilitas di bawah."

