#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.1.rst:83
msgid ""
"Only WiFi scripts are affected: port WINC code to the standard "
":class:`network.WLAN` interface and fix the NINA ``ifconfig()`` argument "
"order (:ref:`the WiFi API change <v4_1_1_wifi>`). All other scripts run "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Hanya skrip WiFi yang terpengaruh: migrasikan kode WINC ke antarmuka "
":class:`network.WLAN` standar dan perbaiki urutan argumen ``ifconfig()`` "
"NINA (\\ :ref:`perubahan API WiFi <v4_1_1_wifi>`\\ ). Semua skrip lainnya "
"berjalan tanpa perubahan."
